{"lyrics":"[00:00.66]You make feel, yeah\n[00:01.94]Uh, I don't wanna try, but\n[00:04.28]So primal, and (Woah)\n[00:05.60]That's what I am (Woah)\n[00:10.58]I'm just a man, yeah, yeah\n[00:15.56]You make feel, yeah\n[00:23.64]So primal, and (Woah)\n[00:28.24]That's what I am (Woah)\n[00:29.20]I'm just a man, yeah, yeah\n[00:39.70]Uh, acidic, a bunch of bad habits with bad magic\n[00:42.74]Can't disappear and re-appear\n[00:44.46]In the same sentence, I'm bad at it\n[00:46.30]The Mad Hatter, the Perc packer\n[00:47.74]The mom thrasher\n[00:48.44]The Perc mixed with the syrup\n[00:49.46]Turn me into a contractor\n[00:50.92]A straight tweak, so high I can't speak\n[00:53.14]Been three weeks, I still haven't met my peak\n[00:55.42](You make me feel)\n[00:58.18]Like I could be someone other than myself\n[01:00.16]Like I could find a little Heaven up in my Hell\n[01:02.30]Yeah, I know it never ever end well\n[01:04.02]Yeah, I know I always fall victim to a rich spell\n[01:06.24]Uh, like abracadabra\n[01:09.06]The flow so raw, forgot to grab Magnums\n[01:11.44]Been raw-doggin' bitches ever since I went platinum\n[01:14.50]I feel like Hell full of bad bitches\n[01:16.20]Wonder if it's room in Heaven for savages\n[01:18.46]My life's a canvas\n[01:19.46]I'm paintin' in blood like a cannibal\n[01:21.36]Rip off his head and I salvage it, huh\n[01:24.28]A little too graphic\n[01:25.46]At least you niggas know that I still got the passion\n[01:27.66]Of someone who don't got shit\n[01:29.20]But the clothes on they back\n[01:30.42]And its been that way since way back since\n[01:32.56](You make me feel)\n[01:35.42]Like I'm a killer or somethin'\n[01:36.56]These niggas lip-singin' like\n[01:37.68]Milli Vanilli or somethin'\n[01:38.86]I'm like Lil' Wayne I got a milli-milli-milli or somethin'\n[01:41.14]I guess, I'm rich, in broke pockets\n[01:45.60]Bountiful, my soul's empty, so deep, ten feet\n[01:49.12](You make me feel)\n[01:49.66]Times ten feet\n[01:50.66](So primal, and, woah)\